+; JMP_DEFFN (52) -- modeled directly on .jmp_proc_header above (PROC's
+; own "JMP skip; STORE_VAR param" preamble), but for DEF FN: emits
+; "DEF FN Pn(Vparam) = " with NO trailing newline -- the body expression
+; that immediately follows accumulates as an ordinary fragment via the
+; normal DECOMPILE_PROGRAM.loop (exactly like any other expression), and
+; .op_ret_deffn below pops that ONE fragment and appends it plus the
+; newline, completing the line this header started.
